cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use cffLaTeX, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "cffLaTeX: Import Citation File Format metadata into LaTeX"
abstract: >-
  cffLaTeX reads the title and authors of a citation from a CITATION.cff file
  into a LaTeX document, so that the metadata is written only once.
